## DELETE session
$ curl -sf -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -X DELETE \
  "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/recommendations/c618464a-c80a-4bbf-8dee-db0ed68f3abb"
204

## Detail after delete (expect 404)
$ curl -s -w "\nHTTP %{http_code}\n" \
  "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/recommendations/c618464a-c80a-4bbf-8dee-db0ed68f3abb"
{"error":{"code":"NOT_FOUND","message":"Recommendation session not found"}}
HTTP 404

